            "type": "MCQ",
            "text": "<span style=\"display: inline;\"><div itemprop=\"text\"><p>Let $x, y, z, a, b, c$ be the attributes of an entity set E . If $\\{x\\},\\{x, y\\},\\{a, b\\},\\{a, b, c\\},\\{x, y, z\\}$ are superkeys then which of the following are the candidate keys?</p></div></span>",
