            "solution": "<div style=\"background-color: #bae1c4; border: 1px solid #75c98a; border-radius: 10px; padding: 10px 15px; margin-top: 15px; color: #155724; font-family: sans-serif;\">  <strong style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #000;\">Explanation:</strong><br> <a name=\"553040\"></a><div itemprop=\"text\"><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"436\" src=\"https://cdn.mathpix.com/snip/images/x4ySCizqZ3VpcdIzh_c3_zt56q7zObD0jvEDlxA5D_c.original.fullsize.png\" width=\"890\"/></p><p> </p><p>At every scheduling decision, calculate the distance from the current head position to each pending request.</p><p>If the current head is at cylinder $50$ and requests are $:20,\\ 47,\\ 65,\\ 90$</p><p>the distances are $:30,\\ 3,\\ 15,\\ 40$</p><p>So SSTF chooses cylinder $47$.</p><p>The algorithm therefore makes a <strong>local greedy choice</strong>:</p><p>$\\boxed{\\mathrm{Choose\\ the\\ nearest\\ pending\\ cylinder}}$</p><p>Hence,</p><p><strong>Answer : </strong>$\\boxed{\\mathrm{C}}$</p></div><br><br><a href=\"https://gateoverflow.in/553037/go-classes-dpp-gate-cs-da-dbms-disk-scheduling#a_list\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-decoration: none; color: #2e7bc5; font-size: 15px;\">Click here for detail solution by gateoverflow</a><div class=\"year_sub_chap_link\" style=\"margin-top:5px; font-size:14px;\"><b><a href=\"https://gateoverflow.in/tag/goclasses-databases-practice-questions\" style=\"color:#2f6d1a; text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\">GO Classes DPP</a></b> <b><a href=\"https://gateoverflow.in/tag/databases\" style=\"color:#2f6d1a; text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\">DBMS - File Organization & Indexing</a></b></div></div>"
